---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Cookie Policy | CBO Salud"
  description="Cookie policy for CBO Salud. This website does not use cookies."
  noIndex
>
  <section class="bg-brand-50 py-16 border-b border-brand-100">
    <div class="container-main max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div
      class="container-main max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-gray prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed max-w-none"
    >
      <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small text files that websites store on your device when you visit them. They
        are used to remember your preferences, analyse site usage and improve your experience.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Cookies we use</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use cookies. We set no first-party or third-party cookies and store no
        information on your device, so there is nothing for you to accept or reject while browsing.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Third-party cookies</h2>
      <p>
        To measure audience we use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a third-party service that runs without
        cookies: it sets no cookies, stores no information on your device, and cannot identify you.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not embed third-party content such as maps or social media posts. Links to Google
        Maps, Instagram or other platforms open that site in a new tab; once there, their own
        privacy and cookie policies apply, which we do not control.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Although this website does not use cookies, you can configure your browser to reject or
        delete cookies set by other websites.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">Google Chrome</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enable-and-disable-cookies-website-preferences"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">Mozilla Firefox</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471/mac"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">Apple Safari</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">Microsoft Edge</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. More information</h2>
      <p>
        For any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us at <a
          href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
          class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">{SITE.email}</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        See also our <a href="/en/privacy-policy" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700"
          >Privacy Policy</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
